#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Apple Blossom Village: a tile-based farming game of seasons, crops and
neighbours, in Python + Tk.

Standard library only.  The engine is the one the tilerpgs share (one hero,
a map of squares, people to talk to by keyword, shops, tiles and music drawn
in code), turned to farming: you've inherited your grandmother's overgrown
farm at the edge of Apple Blossom Village.  Clear it, till it, plant it,
water it, ship what you grow, and get to know the twenty-four people of the
village, who have opinions about everything, birthdays, favourite things,
and stories they tell only to friends.  Twelve of them might come to love you.

Time
  A step is a minute, a swing of a tool three.  Days run from six in the
  morning until two at night; go to bed (walk into your bed) before you
  drop.  Four seasons of 28 days: Spring, Summer, Fall and Winter, each with
  its crops and its festival.

The farm
  Hold a tool and use it on the square in front of you (Space or E, or tap
  the square).  The hoe tills, the watering can waters (fill it at the well
  or any water), seeds go into tilled soil, the axe, pickaxe and scythe
  clear branches, stones and weeds.  Watered crops grow a day each night;
  rain waters them for you.  Ripe crops are picked by hand, and anything
  put in the shipping bin is paid for overnight.

People
  Walk into someone to talk.  Choose or type a word: everyone knows CHAT,
  NAME, JOB, NEWS and GIFT, and words in CAPITALS are worth asking about.
  Talking every day and giving gifts they like earns hearts.  At some
  heart levels a friend will share a moment with you.  The bachelors and
  bachelorettes (Rowan, Felix, Theo, Juniper, Wren, Ivy, Amy, Rusty,
  Marisol, Silas, Dmitri and Jonah) will accept a
  Blossom Bouquet at eight hearts, and a Blossom Pendant at ten.

Touch and mouse
  Tap a square to walk there; tap next to you to step or to use your tool
  there; tap yourself to use your tool ahead.  Gamepad (Linux, Steam Deck):
  d-pad moves, A uses the tool, B backs out, X next tool, Y bag, LB wait,
  RB people, View map, Start menu.

App bundle (macOS):  appleblossomvillage --build-app [DIR]
                     appleblossomvillage --icon-png SIZE [OUT.png]

--selftest builds the valley, every room and tune, and runs a season of
days without opening a window.
"""

